          "value": "General Dentistry",
          "group": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "f4",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "A thorough check-up and clean is the easiest way to stay ahead of decay and gum problems. For Bowen Hills patients, our General Dentistry services also include gum treatment, root canal therapy, extractions and custom night splints for people who clench under the pressure of a demanding job.",
          "group": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "f5",
          "label": "Text",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Explore General Dentistry",
          "group": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "f6",
          "label": "Link address",
          "type": "link",
          "value": "/service/restorative-dentistry/"
        },
        {
          "id": "f7",
          "label": "Subheading",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Restorative Dentistry",
          "group": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "f8",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "If a cracked tooth or old filling has been bothering you, our CEREC same-day crowns can often be designed, milled and fitted in one appointment, meaning fewer trips back and no temporary crown. We also provide fillings, bridges, implants and dentures.",
          "group": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "f9",
          "label": "Text",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Explore Restorative Dentistry",
          "group": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "f10",
          "label": "Link address",
          "type": "link",
          "value": "/service/dental-emergency/"
        },
        {
          "id": "f11",
          "label": "Subheading",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Emergency Dentistry",
          "group": "3"
        },
        {
          "id": "f12",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "A broken tooth or sudden toothache can derail a workday. Our Emergency Dentistry team holds time aside for urgent visits, and being so close to Bowen Hills means you can reach us quickly when it matters.",
          "group": "3"
        },
        {
          "id": "f13",
          "label": "Text",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Explore Emergency Dentistry",
          "group": "3"
        },
        {
          "id": "f14",
