          "value": "Why Bowen Hills Patients Choose Precision Dental"
        },
        {
          "id": "f2",
          "label": "Subheading",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Honesty"
        },
        {
          "id": "f3",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "You will receive a written treatment plan and quote after your examination, and we never pressure anyone to go ahead. If monitoring a concern is a reasonable option, we will tell you."
        },
        {
          "id": "f4",
          "label": "Subheading",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Comfort"
        },
        {
          "id": "f5",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "If you feel uneasy about dental visits, let us know. We can slow things down, pause whenever you need and offer happy gas to help you relax."
        },
        {
          "id": "f6",
          "label": "Subheading",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Quality"
        },
        {
          "id": "f7",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Dr Billy Choi has practised dentistry in Brisbane for more than two decades and continues to attend postgraduate courses to keep his skills current."
        },
        {
          "id": "f8",
          "label": "Subheading",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Convenience"
        },
        {
          "id": "f9",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Free parking on site, appointments from 8am on Fridays and until 7pm on Tuesdays, and on-the-spot HICAPS claims all help keep your visit short and simple."
        },
        {
          "id": "f10",
          "label": "Subheading",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "f11",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "We are an accredited practice, assessed against the National Safety and Quality Health Service Standards."
        }
      ]
    },
