          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Precision Dental is a preferred provider for {{site:preferredFunds}}, and we accept most other major funds. Eligible patients can also spread treatment costs through DentiCare, subject to eligibility, terms and conditions. A deposit and a small set-up fee apply. See our Prices and Payment Options for full details."
